$ Cantilever of CBARs 1 mm long with a 0.1 mm square section in SI units.
$ I1 = I2 = 8.33E-18 m^4 is smaller than machine epsilon but is a real value that must be used as is.
SOL 101
CEND
TITLE = 101_bar_small_i
ECHO = NONE
SPC = 1
LOAD = 1
DISPLACEMENT = ALL
SPCFORCES = ALL
STRESS = ALL
ELFORCE = ALL
BEGIN BULK
PARAM,POST,-1
MAT1,1,2.E+11,,0.3,0.,0.,0.0
PBAR,1,1,1.E-08,8.333333333E-18,8.333333333E-18,1.406E-17,,,+P1
+P1,5.E-5,5.E-5,-5.E-5,5.E-5,-5.E-5,-5.E-5,5.E-5,-5.E-5
GRID,1,,0.,0.,0.0
GRID,2,,0.0005,0.,0.0
GRID,3,,0.001,0.,0.0
CBAR,1,1,1,2,0.0,1.0,0.0
CBAR,2,1,2,3,0.0,1.0,0.0
SPC1,1,123456,1
FORCE,1,3,,1.0E-6,0.0,1.0,2.0
ENDDATA
